# Where this repo is reachable from the public internet.
# Read by ~/.claude/pushed.sh, which asks each one whether it answers.
#
# One host, one port, no port number to type. Tailscale Funnel only permits
# 443, 8443 and 10000, so :8443 was never going to look standard — the green
# cockpit lives at a path on 443 instead, which it could do all along once
# fleet started forwarding the cockpit's routes.

https://cockpit-1.tail151af.ts.net/
https://cockpit-1.tail151af.ts.net/legacy-green-cockpit
